ice, metadata, and empty-state behavior"},{"id":"8","name":"@stynx-nyx/angular-sessions revokes sessions, reloads state, clears busy state, and emits translated warning toasts"},{"id":"9","name":"@stynx-nyx/angular-sessions keeps busy state true until revoke operations settle"},{"id":"10","name":"@stynx-nyx/angular-sessions falls back to untranslated toast keys when no i18n provider is configured"},{"id":"11","name":"@stynx-nyx/angular-sessions throws a clear error when no adapter is provided"},{"id":"12","name":"@stynx-nyx/angular-sessions prefers an input adapter over the provider adapter"},{"id":"13","name":"@stynx-nyx/angular-sessions accepts an input adapter without a provider adapter"}]}},"thresholds":{"break":70,"high":70,"low":60}}
